{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01498",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.73,
      "end_seconds": 3.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "good morning i've just opened your notes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 4.67,
      "end_seconds": 10.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.94,
      "end_seconds": 19.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.95,
      "end_seconds": 28.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "Mainly a mild cough. There's a couple of other things, but that's the the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.5,
      "end_seconds": 34.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "when was the the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.81,
      "end_seconds": 39.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "it's been two months now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.06,
      "end_seconds": 43.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "How frequently does it it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.89,
      "end_seconds": 47.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "It's every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.88,
      "end_seconds": 57.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "okay, how much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.56,
      "end_seconds": 60.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "It's, It's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.11,
      "end_seconds": 67.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.11,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 67.32,
      "end_seconds": 74.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in doctor quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.38,
      "end_seconds": 77.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.54,
      "end_seconds": 83.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "I've, I've also had a runny nose, since yesterday"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.68,
      "end_seconds": 87.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "how much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.22,
      "end_seconds": 102.24,
      "duration_seconds": 13.02,
      "text": "Mostly moderate. Oh, and sneezing. That's been about the same, about four days. I had a scratchy throat before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.75,
      "end_seconds": 109.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Have you had a mild cough before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.24,
      "end_seconds": 117.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "Yes something like this happened last winter and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 135.44,
      "end_seconds": 148.81,
      "duration_seconds": 13.37,
      "text": "Okay, so so the vitals from earlier. Weight 63 kilos, height 164 centimetres, respiratory rate 18. Pulse is 77 beats a minute, BP is 122 over 68, BMI works out to 23.4."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.33,
      "end_seconds": 150.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.54,
      "end_seconds": 154.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.94,
      "end_seconds": 158.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.84,
      "end_seconds": 171.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Your throat is a little red and your chest is clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.44,
      "end_seconds": 177.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "So good you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.36,
      "end_seconds": 189.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Have you had any chest pain or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.1,
      "end_seconds": 194.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "no, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.67,
      "end_seconds": 199.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "a a few quick ones: ear pain or shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.01,
      "end_seconds": 201.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "none of those no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.11,
      "end_seconds": 206.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Right, how are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.39,
      "end_seconds": 210.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.21,
      "end_seconds": 214.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.35,
      "end_seconds": 216.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.92,
      "end_seconds": 222.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.57,
      "end_seconds": 228.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.64,
      "end_seconds": 231.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "so, do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.35,
      "end_seconds": 236.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.68,
      "end_seconds": 240.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.2,
      "end_seconds": 248.97,
      "duration_seconds": 7.77,
      "text": "Propranolol. I take it 40 milligrams twice a day. I take Eltroxin 100 micrograms every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 250.09,
      "end_seconds": 259.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.47,
      "text": "doctor, I think the last prescription for the Eltroxin was 50 micrograms. We changed it at the last visit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.13,
      "end_seconds": 265.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 266.06,
      "end_seconds": 278.02,
      "duration_seconds": 11.96,
      "text": "not with me. I'll bring it next time. I'm on naproxen 250 milligrams twice a day. I'm on throat lozenges when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.92,
      "end_seconds": 280.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "And for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.37,
      "end_seconds": 284.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "About a month now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.31,
      "end_seconds": 290.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.07,
      "end_seconds": 292.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "I have migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.44,
      "end_seconds": 294.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.56,
      "end_seconds": 302.61,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid, for about a year. I have arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.33,
      "end_seconds": 315.17,
      "duration_seconds": 10.84,
      "text": "right so an underactive thyroid and arthritis in your knees are already on your record we'll keep that in mind today have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.71,
      "end_seconds": 326.49,
      "duration_seconds": 10.78,
      "text": "I think I reacted to some antibiotic once years ago. I don't remember which one or what happened exactly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.59,
      "end_seconds": 330.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "what operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.36,
      "end_seconds": 336.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "I had my appendix taken out when I was in my twenties"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.14,
      "end_seconds": 366.34,
      "duration_seconds": 28.2,
      "text": "so based on the history and the examination I'd lean towards a simple viral cold. I'd also keep early flu in mind. Rest plenty of fluids and paracetamol if you ache. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit so we can settle the dose. If you develop a high fever or trouble breathing that's the point to come in urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.25,
      "end_seconds": 371.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "yes, I'll bear that in mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.98,
      "end_seconds": 375.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.46,
      "end_seconds": 380.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor"
    }
  ]
}